Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fnSimHei\fs16\bord0\pos（160，36）\1c&HD6D7D2&}约翰·克莱默
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.20,0:12:14.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（信息发送成功）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.65,0:12:17.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（未知来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:58.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎来到墨西哥）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.00,0:16:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,打劫 不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cambriolage, ne bouge pas{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}vite Get out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.68,0:30:09.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加布里埃拉）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.46,0:32:08.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（未来的外科医生神经外科系列）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.00,0:32:13.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（未来的外科医生系列视频）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.00,0:34:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dónde ir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.11,0:34:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Au diable!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.00,0:35:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comment faire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.00,0:35:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开门 求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouvrez vite, s'il vous pla?t{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.00,0:35:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门 克莱默\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouvrez la porte Kramer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.00,0:36:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去 你这个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laisse - moi sortir, fou.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.19,0:40:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quel est votre nom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.46,0:40:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦伦蒂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valentina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.59,0:40:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦伦蒂娜 你真是个漂亮的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valentina. Tu es une belle fille.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.82,0:40:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想出去约吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tu veux sortir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.74,0:40:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来点刺激的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vamos a tener un poco de emoción.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.50,0:40:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}qué tal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.50,0:40:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 随便你 - 请\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lo que sea - Por favo{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.97,0:40:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Entrez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.11,0:40:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的钱呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Et mon argent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.53,0:40:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quel argent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.57,0:40:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有钱 不做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pas d'argent, pas de sexe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.87,0:40:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从来没有谈过钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nous n'avons jamais parlé d'argent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.82,0:40:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Non, non!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.57,0:40:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Non, non!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.23,0:41:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Non, non, non, non!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.54,0:41:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 马特奥 - 别忘了锁门\N{\fnArial\fs30}à plus tard, Mateo. N'oublie pas de fermer à clé.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.39,0:41:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗粮准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}La nourriture des chiens est prête?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.27,0:41:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oui.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.30,0:41:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们先走了 明天见 - 明天见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nos vamos primero, nos vemos mañana - Nos vemos mañana{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.30,0:41:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,先打个劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Les têtes de noeuds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.61,0:42:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脸色不太好 要注意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tu as une sale gueule, Gabriela.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.33,0:42:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要找一个新的药品销售商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tu dois trouver un nouveau vendeur de médicaments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.73,0:42:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再这样做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Je ne le ferai plus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.48,0:44:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}C'est occupé.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.52,0:44:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Que voulez-vous?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.06,0:44:51.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（约翰·克莱默脑癌$25万美元）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.60,0:57:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, mon Dieu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.50,1:06:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 我是佩德森 快来救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}hai Pederson, viens me sauver{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.65,1:39:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ne tirez pas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.65,1:39:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ne tirez pas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.33,1:44:15.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警告 危险化学毒气）
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.33,1:46:26.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（帕克·希尔斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs48\pos（192，220）\fscx110\1c&H00002F&\3c&H5B658E&}{\fad（400，800）}美国狮门影业公司
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs48\pos（190，240）\fscx130\1c&H9F9690&\3c&H484640&}{\fad（3000，0）}美国扭曲影业公司
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.30,0:00:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs48\pos（190，240）\fscx130\1c&H9F9690&\3c&H484640&}美国扭曲 影业公司
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.35,0:00:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fnSimHei\fs23\pos（190，135）\fscx130\1c&H000A69&}{\fad（500，600）}狮门影业公开发行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fnSimHei\fs23\pos（192，125）\fscx130\1c&H000A69&}{\fad（500，600）}扭曲影业联合奉献
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.72,0:01:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次时间很长啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a long one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.63,0:01:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是没法告诉我结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose you can tell me how it looks, can you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我只是技术员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, I'm just the technician.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.37,0:01:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的医生明天会告诉你结果的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your doctor will have your results tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你需不需要我帮忙 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you like some help to - Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.17,0:02:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fnSimHei\fs50\bord0\pos（192，82）\fscx130\1c&H00084B&}{\fad（2500，1800）}电 锯 惊 魂 10
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.82,0:02:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, yeah, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.65,0:02:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,癌症让我生活的每一秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}the cancer has brought grief and pain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.99,0:02:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,都充满了恐惧和悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fear into my every waking moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.23,0:02:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉斯 最重要的是活在当下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Chris. Today is a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,“此时此刻”才是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they call it the present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁想分享吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.84,0:02:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利·凯斯勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry Kessler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.58,0:02:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你请吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.04,0:02:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,胰腺癌四期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stage four pancreatic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生跟我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.25,0:02:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已经是晚期了 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what they tell me, anyway, but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会战斗到底的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna fight this 'til the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.93,0:02:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有多长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much time do I have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.17,0:02:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一年吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A year?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,最多几个月吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Months at best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.20,0:02:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有很多工作要做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still have a lot of work that needs to be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的建议是\N{\fnArial\fs30}My advice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.01,0:03:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,退休吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.18,0:03:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你这种情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, at this stage, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.28,0:03:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都想找到一个出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone always searches for a way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.85,0:03:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有时候 接受自己命运安排的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sometimes, those who accept their fate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,才过得最轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}have an easier time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.06,0:03:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻松 什么轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easier time? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.09,0:03:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,死得轻松吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.73,0:03:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你的建议是 让我轻松地去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, your advice to me is to die easy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Hey! Help! Help, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.32,0:04:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟你玩个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to play a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:05:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也许能帮你治好手脚不干净的毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps one that addresses those sticky fingers of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我注意你很久了 而且我很不满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had my eyes on you and I do not like what I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,医院保洁是个崇高的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your job as a custodian is a noble one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.44,0:05:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扫消杀 帮助减少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanitizing and sterilizing the hospital{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.41,0:05:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,疾病的传播\N{\fnArial\fs30}helping patients avoid sickness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.51,0:05:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你内心的疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is a sickness inside you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.45,0:05:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也需要被清除\N{\fnArial\fs30}that needs to be excised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.35,0:05:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在有个机会 拯救你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the ability to not only save{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.69,0:05:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时还能保住你的视力\N{\fnArial\fs30}your soul today, but your sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.69,0:05:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要把转盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do is click the dial{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.13,0:05:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,转动五次\N{\fnArial\fs30}across the five positions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就能活下来 见到明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will live to see another day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一分钟决择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have 60 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.37,0:05:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.54,0:05:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me Please, please, please. Help. Help{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.13,0:06:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't I can't, I can't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.53,0:06:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, no{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,操你妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.08,0:07:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.73,0:07:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一块蓝莓司康饼 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get a blueberry scone, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.64,0:07:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they look good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.97,0:07:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.38,0:08:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是癌症互助小组的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were in the same cancer support group.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.08,0:08:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·克莱默\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.16,0:08:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.03,0:08:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look marvelous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.30,0:08:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我现在感觉也很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. I I I feel great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道我是不是记错了 你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct me if I'm wrong, but you were, uh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.74,0:08:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 胰腺癌四期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, stage four pancreatic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.27,0:08:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是四个月之前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now, four months later, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.41,0:08:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在已经完全好转了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in complete remission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.31,0:08:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a it's a long story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.39,0:08:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.59,0:08:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有时间跟我讲讲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a minute to tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.03,0:08:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:08:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, um, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:09:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说过这个领域的一个专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read about a doctor, a specialist of sorts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬·佩德森博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Dr. Finn Pederson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.07,0:09:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会进行一种治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He offered a treatment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把药物鸡尾酒疗法与手术相结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it is a groundbreaking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.52,0:09:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是突破性的疗法\N{\fnArial\fs30}drug cocktail combined with surgery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.29,0:09:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的战斗勋章\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my war wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.43,0:09:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道看起来很吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it looks bad, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但绝对值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was totally worth it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.23,0:09:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.67,0:09:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以在这里接受治疗吗 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it available here? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.91,0:09:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在美国没法进行这种治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, the treatment's not available in the States.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.68,0:09:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有获得食品药品管理局的批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}The, uh, the medication isn't approved by the FDA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实在任何地方都没有获批\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, it isn't approved by anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.45,0:09:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在挪威接受的治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, um I haven't seen them since{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.89,0:09:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那之后就再也没见过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}since my treatment in Norway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个链接\N{\fnArial\fs30}this link{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.97,0:10:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,依然有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}is still good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.58,0:10:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, John, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.78,0:10:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}good luck, man. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.31,0:10:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm I'm rooting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.42,0:10:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.47,0:10:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 这种治疗是什么原理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, what exactly is the procedure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在特定的环境下 经过适当的刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, under the right circumstances and with the proper stimuli, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,基因可以像开关一样 被激活或者关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}genes can be turned on and turned off like a light switch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.91,0:10:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会针对癌症细胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're targeting the cancer cells?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:10:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.82,0:10:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功研发出了 最尖端的药物鸡尾酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we've managed to do is to create a new cutting-edge drug cocktail, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.42,0:10:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,再配合手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}along with surgery, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.76,0:11:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能让有害的细胞失活\N{\fnArial\fs30}to teach the malignant cells to switch off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.39,0:11:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,太神奇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,腐败政府与大型制药公司勾结\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father, Dr. Finn Pederson, was forced into hiding{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.34,0:11:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲 芬·佩德森博士 被迫躲藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}by corrupt governments and their relationship to big pharma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.18,0:11:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我的父亲即将成功治愈 数十种疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because my father was on the cusp of curing dozens of diseases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.25,0:11:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 患者不再需要终生服药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means no more need for lifelong medication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.63,0:11:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能想象这将会有什么影响吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you imagine what that implies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.23,0:11:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,大型制药公司对此心知肚明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the big drug companies certainly can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.03,0:11:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能接受这种打压\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm here to say that this just cannot stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.37,0:11:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 在我的父亲继续完善其成果的同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, while my father continues to make further improvements to his formula, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将证实他的治疗方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking his treatment on the road{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.81,0:11:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行更多测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}for more trials, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.11,0:12:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,从而尽可能地拯救生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}to save as many lives as humanly possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞西莉亚·佩德森\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Cecilia Pederson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.69,0:12:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是约翰·克莱默吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this John Kramer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.09,0:12:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.39,0:12:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.03,0:12:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们收到了你的邮件和医疗记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}We received the email with your medical records, Mr. Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你联系我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for reaching out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在为我们的项目筛选实验对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sifting through potential candidates for our program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.27,0:12:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天给你打电话是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'm calling you now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们三个月后的治疗有空位\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we have spots opening for treatment in about three months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.78,0:13:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱默先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kramer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yes, I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等不了三个月了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have three months, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, listen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.59,0:13:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在正在墨西哥工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm currently working in Mexico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在奥斯陆已经待不下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oslo has become too difficult for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.39,0:13:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里有一支专家团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have a team of specialists here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.46,0:13:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都相信佩德森疗法\N{\fnArial\fs30}who share our belief in the Pederson method{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也找到了一批患者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've gathered a group of eligible patients{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,会在下周开始治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to start treatment a week from now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.30,0:13:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你感兴趣的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I could add one more spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.97,0:13:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以多加一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're interested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.61,0:13:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm interested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.78,0:13:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利·凯斯勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry Kessler{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.91,0:13:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他把你们介绍给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}referred me to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.15,0:13:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利啊 看来他情况不错 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry. He's doing well. I'm so pleased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.32,0:13:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder if you could{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.48,0:13:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,多给我介绍一下治疗的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}could you tell me a little more about the treatment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,治疗分为两个部分 一个是我父亲的药物鸡尾酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a two-prong treatment that uses my father's Xaxiophenol cocktail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.59,0:13:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及手术切除肿瘤 对你来说就是颅脑手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in your case, it would be combined with a cranial surgery to clear the tumor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.40,0:13:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,两者结合的效果非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}When both are used together, the results have been stunning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功率超过九成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over 90% success rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.81,0:14:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道路途遥远\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's a long trip, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.04,0:14:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱默先生 特别是你的情况不适宜旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kramer, especially in your condition, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.48,0:14:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们的诊所环境非常优美\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I want you to know that we found a very beautiful location{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.91,0:14:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在墨西哥城外\N{\fnArial\fs30}for our clinic outside Mexico City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.58,0:14:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在一个远离网格的郊区\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in a well-off-the-grid area, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常隐蔽 绝对能保证安全和隐私\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the countryside where you can have safety and privacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.05,0:14:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你你抵达之后 我们会安排可靠的司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll also, of course, arrange for a trusted driver at your arrival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}What date did you have in mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,五号 下周五\N{\fnArial\fs30}The 5th, Friday after next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I could make that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰·克莱默 - 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- J. Kramer? Yeah? - Si. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是迪亚哥 欢迎来到墨西哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Diego. Welcome to Mexico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.95,0:14:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来吧 这辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me, sir. Please. This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.56,0:14:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.70,0:15:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是城都主教座堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the Metropolitan Cathedral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是革命纪念碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the revolutionary memorial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.94,0:15:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是独立天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the Angel of Independence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.34,0:15:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个 是不是很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look at that. Isn't it beautiful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.41,0:15:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, J.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.61,0:15:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 那是阿兹特克的特拉洛克雕像\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, my friend, that's the old Aztec statue of Tlaloc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,祭司就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where the priests{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.35,0:15:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,剜出人的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}chop the hearts out of their subjects{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.25,0:15:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后扔到楼下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and roll them down the stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.56,0:15:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天都有游客让我带他们来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day, a tourist wants me to take them here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.56,0:15:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.35,0:15:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, J.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.61,0:15:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.87,0:16:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.73,0:16:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·克莱默\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,再敢撒谎就让你脑袋开花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lie to me again and I'll empty this chamber in your eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.81,0:16:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没撒谎 我叫约翰·克莱默\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not lying. My name is John Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.48,0:16:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心 克莱默先生 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to worry, senor Kramer, you're fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.21,0:16:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很安全 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're safe. Come with me. Come, come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车吧 小心头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Welcome. Watch your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.00,0:16:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Es aquí dentro{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.61,0:16:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.05,0:16:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里了 祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's here. Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.26,0:17:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Si?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.23,0:17:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是约翰·克莱默\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am John Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.83,0:17:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮您\N{\fnArial\fs30}help you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.34,0:17:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 加布里埃拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I Gabriela.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.79,0:17:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mi familia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.66,0:17:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.97,0:17:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡觉 这里睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep. Sleep here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.87,0:18:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞西莉亚·佩德森博士呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Cecilia Pederson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Si.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她救命 救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saved life. My life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.22,0:18:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去 去叫她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get. I get now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.17,0:18:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱默先生 欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kramer, welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,路上的欢迎仪式还挺特别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was quite a reception that I got on the way out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.95,0:18:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我们的迎宾车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, our welcome wagon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.32,0:18:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不管去哪我们都必须加强安保\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we've had to beef up the security wherever we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.86,0:18:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大型制药公司一直对我们穷追不舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big drug companies are always one step behind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们的地址必须保密 连你也不能告诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so we must keep our location secret from everyone, even you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.70,0:18:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.77,0:18:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,见见我们的团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to meet the team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.15,0:19:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是卡洛斯 这里的足球明星\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Carlos. Our local football star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.25,0:19:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他父亲是这里的管理员\N{\fnArial\fs30}His father is the caretaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.21,0:19:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里以前是个化工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}This used to be a chemical factory back in the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,马特奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mateo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.89,0:20:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是约翰·克莱默\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is John Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 克莱默先生 欢迎来到我们的诊所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very nice to meet you, Mr. Kramer, and welcome to our clinic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.69,0:20:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会好好照顾你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in very good hands with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.66,0:20:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,马特奥是阿尔托普拉多医院的麻醉师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mateo is an anesthesiologist at Hospital Alto Prado.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.13,0:20:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在约翰·霍普金斯大学完成了住院医师实习 经常与我父亲共事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did his residency at Johns Hopkins and has worked a lot with my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.97,0:20:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 他会参与你明天的手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - He'll be helping out with your surgery tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.11,0:20:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有任何需要就来这里找我 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be right here if you need anything. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.38,0:20:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是瓦伦蒂娜 我们的护士之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Valentina, one of our nurses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.92,0:20:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会帮你进行扫描 抽血\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be taking some scans and drawing some blood, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.92,0:20:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为今天晚些时候的注射治疗做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}all in preparation for the injection therapy later today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.19,0:21:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,希尔斯先生的结果很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Sears' vitals look good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.52,0:21:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以出院了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's cleared for release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.79,0:21:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.33,0:21:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克·希尔斯 约翰·克莱默\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker Sears, John Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.33,0:21:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,甲状腺癌 晚期 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thyroid cancer, advanced. You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,大脑肿瘤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.34,0:21:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. You win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我昨天做的手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, they cut me open yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.82,0:21:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,切掉了阴茎大小的肿瘤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took out a tumor the size of my knob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就要开始鸡尾酒疗法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just about to start the cocktail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,突变的天然杀手细胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mutated natural killer cells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.56,0:21:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我父亲研发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a type of cytotoxic lymphocyte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.19,0:21:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,细胞毒性淋巴细胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Developed by my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.03,0:21:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.83,0:21:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经给你定好了酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we've arranged for you to stay at a hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.80,0:21:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we begin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.38,0:21:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.42,0:22:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱默先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Mr. Kramer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.89,0:22:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是做什么工作的 - 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you do? Like, for a living? - John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.50,0:22:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我约翰就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, call me John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.43,0:22:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是做什么工作的 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you do, John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.60,0:22:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当了大半辈子的土木工程师和建筑师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been a civil engineer and an architect most of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.31,0:22:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.41,0:22:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就做些业余爱好\N{\fnArial\fs30}have a few hobbies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.38,0:22:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.35,0:22:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻新老爷车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Classic car renovation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.95,0:22:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.19,0:22:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.32,0:22:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮助人们克服内心的障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I help people overcome inner obstacles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.53,0:22:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助他们在生活中做出积极的改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help them make positive changes in their lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.96,0:22:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似心理教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a life coach, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.00,0:22:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.90,0:22:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.70,0:22:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助他人就是最有意义的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't think of anything more important than helping others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.97,0:22:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.61,0:23:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙舌兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tequila.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.08,0:23:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,能带来好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}For good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.72,0:23:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 加布里埃拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Gabriela.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.95,0:23:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}De nada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.09,0:23:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地人的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a local favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.22,0:23:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你现在不能喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't drink it now, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.59,0:23:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,术前不能饮酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not before surgery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.43,0:23:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,“我的太阳西沉 是为了再度升起”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"My sun sets to rise again."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.57,0:23:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的太阳一定会再度升起 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sun is rising again, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.97,0:23:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会确保这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will make sure of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.63,0:24:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会英语吗 卡洛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak English, Carlos?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.00,0:24:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Que?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.86,0:24:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来跟我的西班牙语水平差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's about as good as my Spanish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.74,0:24:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,“拉”怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you say "pull"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.11,0:24:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉 拉 拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull, pull. Pull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.41,0:24:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈拉尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}halar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.51,0:24:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈拉尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}halar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.48,0:24:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 哈拉尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent. halar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.49,0:24:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gracias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.56,0:25:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,手术是谁主刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who performs the surgery?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.03,0:25:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷蒙·科尔特斯医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Ramone Cortez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.10,0:25:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是阿尔托普拉多的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also at Alto Prado.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.37,0:25:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是这个国家最优秀的神经外科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the best neurosurgeon in 2, 000 miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.34,0:25:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会放心把我的家人交给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the doctor I'd use if my own family was on the table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.88,0:25:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会进行“清醒开颅手术”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we'll be performing an "awake craniotomy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.15,0:25:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有部分时间是清醒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This means that you'll be floating in and out of consciousness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.05,0:25:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们可以进行脑功能测绘\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that we can do function mapping{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.45,0:25:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,监控你的脑部活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}This allows us to monitor your abilities, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.29,0:25:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了不损伤你的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that we don't touch any part of your brain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.66,0:25:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制语言和运动功能的区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}that might affect speech or movement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.20,0:26:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱默先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kramer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.66,0:26:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,能动一下手指吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you please wiggle your fingers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.47,0:26:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 运动功能完好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Motor function is clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.27,0:26:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备抽吸管 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suction vac, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.13,0:26:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦伦蒂娜 挪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valentina, will you move{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.44,0:26:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, right, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.56,0:27:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 现在你可以休息一下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, great. We're gonna put you back to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.82,0:27:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从10倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna count down from ten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.23,0:27:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,10\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.23,0:27:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,9、8\N{\fnArial\fs30}nine, eight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.27,0:27:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,7、6\N{\fnArial\fs30}seven, six{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.58,0:27:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.48,0:27:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.75,0:27:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.75,0:27:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在马特奥的医院附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're two blocks away from Mateo's hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.42,0:27:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防你需要输血\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case you need a transfusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.85,0:27:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的血检结果出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got your bloodwork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.13,0:27:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,血红蛋白正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hemoglobin's normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.87,0:27:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果看起来很好 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It all looks good, John.{\r}
