Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.42,0:50:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你听我说 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, listen to me. I beg you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.36,0:50:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg you, please. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.76,0:50:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟这件事无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have nothing to do with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.30,0:50:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本不知道是怎么回事 都是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't know what was going on. It was all her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.33,0:50:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,整件事都是她策划的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She planned the whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.30,0:50:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,马特奥 我都不知道这是不是你的真名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mateo, I don't even know if that's your real name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.51,0:50:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是我的真名 - 是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is my real name. - It is, oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.71,0:50:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是医院说没有你这个员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause they have never heard of you at the hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.28,0:50:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她让我说我在那里工作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me to say that I worked there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.92,0:50:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是医生 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I don't. I'm sorry. - Mm, mm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.65,0:50:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你听我解释 - 克莱默先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please wait. Let me explain. - Mr. Kramer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.19,0:51:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant no harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.53,0:51:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想相信你 加布里埃拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would really like to believe you, Gabriela.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.17,0:51:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给你机会证明自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have a chance to prove yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.67,0:51:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Por favor. Por favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.25,0:51:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还你自由的钥匙 就在这个盒子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key to your freedom is inside that box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.09,0:51:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.63,0:51:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是吉利锯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Gigli saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.96,0:51:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说盒子里有钥匙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said there was a key?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.77,0:51:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个比喻\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was speaking metaphorically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.83,0:51:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他经常这么说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does that a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.04,0:51:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I get out of here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.14,0:51:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你们两个狗娘养的都杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill both of you motherfuckers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.98,0:51:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这计划不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.58,0:51:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果想要成功实施\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna wanna really listen carefully{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.98,0:52:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要仔细听游戏规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the rules in order to pull that off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.29,0:52:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,操你妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.70,0:52:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.67,0:52:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.80,0:52:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.47,0:52:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.48,0:52:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,盒子里的那根线锯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wire saw inside of that box{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.01,0:52:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是由意大利医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}was invented by an Italian physician.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.52,0:52:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱昂纳多·吉利发明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leonardo Gigli.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.25,0:52:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,能非常干净利落地切断骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}It creates an extraordinarily clean-cut to the bone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.56,0:52:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.16,0:52:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.13,0:52:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.74,0:53:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你腿上的虚线就是切割位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dotted line on your leg marks the spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.81,0:53:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you fucking crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.25,0:53:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要切断自己的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think I'd fucking cut off my own leg?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.42,0:53:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为如果你不这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you don't, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.35,0:53:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脖子前面的线锯\N{\fnArial\fs30}the wire saw that's wrapped around your neck{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.16,0:53:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,会先切开你的皮肤\N{\fnArial\fs30}will first cut into your skin, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.93,0:53:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后切断你的椎骨韧带\N{\fnArial\fs30}then your vertebral ligaments, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.06,0:53:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后切断你的颈椎\N{\fnArial\fs30}and finally, it'll sever your spinal cord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.46,0:53:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.23,0:53:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单来说就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The CliffsNotes version?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.47,0:53:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会把你的脑袋割下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna cut your head off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.41,0:53:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.81,0:53:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.88,0:53:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.78,0:53:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.68,0:53:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.28,0:53:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但瓦伦蒂娜也许会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Valentina might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.06,0:53:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.03,0:53:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.90,0:53:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.53,0:54:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们向垂死之人做出了承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised dying people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.11,0:54:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,垂死之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dying people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.34,0:54:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们承诺救他们的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you could save their lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.85,0:54:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这么做的时候 是利用了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in doing so, you took advantage of the only thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.59,0:54:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一拥有的东西：\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they still possessed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.86,0:54:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.53,0:54:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的 约翰 我们治好了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, John. We've worked to heal people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.20,0:54:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的情况很特殊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your case was different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.44,0:54:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And still you lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.94,0:54:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的助手阿曼达 查过了你的银行流水\N{\fnArial\fs30}My associate, Amanda here, has had a look at your bank records.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.34,0:54:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.08,0:54:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这34个人都是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are those 34 people to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.32,0:54:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说约翰的情况很特殊\N{\fnArial\fs30}John's case was different?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.45,0:54:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这34个人里有被你们治好的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you heal any of those 34 people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.66,0:54:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有孩子吗 是不是都成了孤儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they have children that are now orphaned?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.36,0:54:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进行这种犯罪活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been doing this larcenist dance now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.93,0:55:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经八年多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for more than eight years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.66,0:55:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,八年啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.50,0:55:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗了超过八百万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's more than $8 million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.10,0:55:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了获取财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a lot of pain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.50,0:55:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to inflict on others{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.97,0:55:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,带来了巨大的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your own enrichment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.84,0:55:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本没有治疗 贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no healing going on there, bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.11,0:55:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们全都入土了 我查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all underground. I checked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.82,0:55:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.92,0:55:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们掌握了你的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.75,0:55:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括你家里的现金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including the cash from your house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.82,0:55:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在楼上呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have it upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.29,0:55:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你们 不要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please, don't do this. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.60,0:55:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.30,0:55:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.67,0:55:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在救你 瓦伦蒂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly what we are doing, Valentina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.87,0:55:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not retribution, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.10,0:55:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是救赎\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a reawakening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.81,0:55:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦伦蒂娜 想要活命 就听我指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valentina, follow my instructions if you want to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.61,0:55:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,人体内的骨髓超过两公斤\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are more than five pounds of marrow in the human body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.02,0:55:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要贡献出85克\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you need is three ounces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.45,0:55:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你股骨中的骨髓远不只这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's more than enough in your femur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.32,0:56:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要把里面的骨髓吸出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just suction it out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.62,0:56:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会转移到那边的设备上\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll be transferred to that device right there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.86,0:56:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就会关闭你脖子前面的线锯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it will deactivate the saw around your neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.13,0:56:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hesitate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.53,0:56:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你的时间有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because your time is prescribed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.50,0:56:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.31,0:56:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 你们不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, refusing to play the game{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.27,0:56:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拒绝参加游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}is not an option.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.18,0:56:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为一旦拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you refuse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.51,0:56:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就会永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will remain in this room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.21,0:56:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.32,0:56:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.19,0:56:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要一直保持清醒就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long as you keep your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.09,0:56:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本没有参与啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were not involved in the whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.49,0:56:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你了 - 约翰 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please. - John Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.36,0:56:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.17,0:56:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.70,0:56:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这种人居然给我讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lecture in moral decency?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.01,0:56:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是非对错\N{\fnArial\fs30}From you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.28,0:56:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, John. John{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.95,0:56:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你等等 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, wait, John{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.12,0:57:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.88,0:57:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.08,0:57:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please, please, help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.49,0:57:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, please wait{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.76,0:57:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please wait Please wait{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.07,0:57:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.98,0:57:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.45,0:57:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 求你了 没必要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, please wait You don't have to do this John John{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.86,0:57:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.26,0:57:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦伦蒂娜 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valentina, look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.79,0:57:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me{\r}
