Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.85,1:10:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过你 克莱默\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you. Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.32,1:10:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑癌 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brain cancer, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.36,1:10:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这里干什么 帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here, Parker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.06,1:10:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,来要我的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to get my money back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.63,1:10:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那群人都是骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are just crooks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.73,1:10:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.24,1:10:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.22,1:10:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是佩德森吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Pederson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.35,1:11:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有马特奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Mateo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.89,1:11:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,加布里埃拉 瓦伦蒂娜 迪亚哥也参与了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriela, Valentina, and Diego was in on it too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.90,1:11:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all con artists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.36,1:11:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we, we were the suckers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.33,1:11:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.34,1:11:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把所有钱都给她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave her everything. All the money I had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.47,1:11:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是留给我家人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was for my family, that money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.74,1:11:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在我死后留给孩子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make good with my kids when I was gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.75,1:11:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却拿来换“魔豆”了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But instead, you traded it for magic beans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.52,1:11:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,换更多时间 换一个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}More time, a shot at life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.75,1:11:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克 你的生命对你来说 到底意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your life really mean to you, Parker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.79,1:11:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever thought about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.59,1:11:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为只要你能找到生命的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you find the meaning of your life, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.56,1:11:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就等于找到了灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you've found is your soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.00,1:11:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的钱在我们这里 你不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have your money. You can be assured of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.60,1:11:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在我让你去见塞西莉亚之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But before I let you confront Cecilia, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.17,1:11:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须先让她完成这个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a game that she has to play out to its conclusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.21,1:11:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean a game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.05,1:12:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.12,1:12:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了瓦伦蒂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed Valentina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.22,1:12:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.69,1:12:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的都把她的头给砍下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chopped her fucking head off{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.86,1:12:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦伦蒂娜的死 是因为她的生存意志不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valentina died because she didn't have the will to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.26,1:12:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没能通过测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}She failed her test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.69,1:12:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 既然他能找到这里 别人也能\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, if he found us here, others might too, and soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.87,1:12:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再浪费时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're wasting time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.20,1:12:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想给希尔斯先生一个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to give Mr. Sears{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.67,1:12:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他可以做出选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}a chance to make his choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.87,1:12:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}What choice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.81,1:12:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪有选择 你们到底在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a choice. What are you two fucking talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.51,1:12:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给你一个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to give you an opportunity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.38,1:12:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你能够在此时此地参与\N{\fnArial\fs30}to do something significant with your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.82,1:12:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.95,1:12:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.95,1:12:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一点要先说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, I'm going to have to insist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.92,1:12:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能用枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}no guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.93,1:12:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,规则就是规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rules are rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.00,1:12:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,违法规则的后果非常严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consequences for breaking them will be dire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.87,1:12:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.81,1:13:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把我解开了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undo me now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.82,1:13:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.52,1:13:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达 我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you, Amanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.12,1:13:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管过程如何 最后一切都会按计划进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}One way or another, it's all gonna work out according to plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.93,1:13:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去帮加布里埃拉准备下一个游戏吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go and prepare Gabriela for the next game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.17,1:13:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想让我去吗 - 不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want me to do it? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.08,1:13:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个应该是麻醉师\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the anesthesiologist is next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.96,1:13:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 能跟你谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady, can you talk to me, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.96,1:13:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 让我跟你谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you Can you please talk to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.99,1:13:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please talk to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.46,1:13:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个臭婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking bitch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.80,1:13:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking cunt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.64,1:14:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.31,1:14:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, help me. Help me. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.55,1:14:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚已经救你一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe it or not, I just did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.21,1:14:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 本来你是下一个 - 他是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were next. - He's a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.95,1:14:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要杀了我们 也会杀了你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna kill you the same way he's gonna kill all of us. Please{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.62,1:14:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不了解约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.15,1:14:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想我继续帮你 就不要再说这种话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want any more of my help, keep your mouth shut about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.71,1:14:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不想让我一枪干掉那个骗子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so I don't shoot that thief in the face?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.71,1:14:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 希尔斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, Mr. Sears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.75,1:14:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快她就会希望自己 能被你一枪打死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In short order, she'll wish that you had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.04,1:15:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,马特奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mateo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.01,1:15:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.00,1:15:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.34,1:15:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.23,1:16:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.03,1:16:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这些是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what the fuck all of these things are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.63,1:16:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是医疗用品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medical supplies, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.33,1:16:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一把骨锯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's a fucking bone cutter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.70,1:16:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是开颅器\N{\fnArial\fs30}A craniotome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.17,1:16:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈的不想知道它叫什么 塞西莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what the fucking thing is called, Cecilia{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.11,1:16:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个东西 写着“播放我”\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's this thing that says "Play me."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.24,1:16:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对不碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna touch that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.22,1:16:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.46,1:16:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 马特奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Mateo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.66,1:16:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到你玩游戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to play a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.69,1:16:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,规则很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rules are simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.89,1:16:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要把足够大的一块脑组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place a big enough piece of your cerebral tissue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.03,1:16:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,放进那个玻璃酶罐里 你就赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the glass enzyme tank and you win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.44,1:16:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一块什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}A piece of what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.57,1:16:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一块什么 - 灰质\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A piece of what? - Gray matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.67,1:16:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.68,1:16:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是一块你的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}A piece of your brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.08,1:16:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.58,1:16:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯了吧 克莱默\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is insane. - Kramer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.41,1:17:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, please{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.29,1:17:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱默\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kramer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.35,1:17:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.59,1:17:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能在三分钟内完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you complete your task in less than three minutes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.99,1:17:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,罐子里的酶会溶解脑组织 关闭电路\N{\fnArial\fs30}the enzymes will dissolve the tissue to close a circuit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.77,1:17:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的命就保住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will save your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.73,1:17:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But know this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.74,1:17:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,大脑是适应能力极其强大的器官\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brain is a remarkably resilient organ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.97,1:17:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人经历了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There have been accounts of people undergoing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.14,1:17:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,完整的解剖半球切除术\N{\fnArial\fs30}complete anatomical hemispherectomies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.85,1:17:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说切掉了半个大脑 但大脑仍然能重新适应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half their brain removed, only to have it rewire itself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.85,1:17:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,患者不仅活了下来 而且非常健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that the patient not only survives, but thrives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.39,1:17:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.86,1:17:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.20,1:17:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.10,1:17:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提供了你需要的一切 除了麻醉剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing I have not provided is your anesthetic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.40,1:17:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是相信我 你最好保持清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}But trust me, you will want to remain alert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.67,1:18:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you fail to act, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.34,1:18:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果将非常可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}the consequences will not go well for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.28,1:18:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not waste time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.12,1:18:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是生是死 选择权在你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live or die, the choice is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.03,1:18:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.99,1:18:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得把这东西拆下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to take this thing off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.60,1:18:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来人 救救我 - 马特奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Somebody help me. - Mateo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.10,1:18:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办 我该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I do? What do I do? What do I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.50,1:18:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,用那个开颅器\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to use the craniotome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.81,1:18:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,马特奥 没有别的办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mateo, you have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.68,1:18:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not going to fucking happen.{\r}
