Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.32,1:22:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,人为了活命 什么话都能说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}people will say almost anything to save their own life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.92,1:22:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但她父亲是真实存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but her father's real.{\r}
