Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.19,1:22:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达 事实就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda, the reality is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.86,1:22:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.83,1:22:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.70,1:22:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须面对这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to face that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.00,1:22:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们的事业不会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}But our work's not gonna end.{\r}
