Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.24,1:24:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我们永远都逃不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll never get out of here otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.13,1:24:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
