Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.75,1:24:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾 这样没有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid that's not going to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.39,1:24:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须参加这个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are going to have to play the game.{\r}
