Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.49,1:25:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,治愈了我的癌症\N{\fnArial\fs30}to cure my cancer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.02,1:26:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我已经接受了很多年的治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have spent years in treatment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.76,1:26:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,化疗 放疗 免疫疗法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chemotherapy, immunotherapy, radiation.{\r}
