Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.11,1:28:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.91,1:28:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no. No.{\r}
