Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.11,1:29:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的规则 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck your rules, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.78,1:29:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,把塞西莉亚镣铐的钥匙给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The keys to Cecilia's chains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.98,1:29:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要钥匙 她哪里也不会去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need the keys. She's not going anywhere.{\r}
