Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.17,1:30:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.83,1:31:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,从见到你的那一刻 我就一直想揍你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been wanting to do that since the moment I met you.{\r}
