Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.22,1:32:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫做“你死我们活 去你妈的”\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called we live, you die, fuck you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.16,1:32:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.36,1:32:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早说过 帕克会违反规则的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you Parker would break the rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.73,1:32:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没能通过测试 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You failed your test, asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.60,1:32:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得送她去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get her to a hospital.{\r}
