Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.60,1:32:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她应该活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she deserves to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.44,1:32:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, does she now?{\r}
