Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.29,1:32:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.72,1:32:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.56,1:32:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sick bitch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.50,1:32:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾 我觉得她撑不下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, I don't think she's gonna make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.67,1:32:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.48,1:33:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把钥匙给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.59,1:33:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你自己锁起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock yourself in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.56,1:33:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, tell me, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.03,1:33:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做这种事已经很长时间了 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been doing this for a very long time, haven't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.43,1:33:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会被我阻止了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did I stop you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.70,1:33:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就这么厉害吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I just that good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.77,1:34:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别自吹自擂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't flatter yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.24,1:34:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是判断有误 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had a lapse in judgement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.50,1:34:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's all. - Yeah, I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.41,1:34:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 对你这种聪明人来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a guy as smart as you are, John, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.74,1:34:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的行为有点盲目自信了 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}you kind of overplayed your hand here, wouldn't you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.11,1:34:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't give a shit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.38,1:34:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,都被你害死了 你根本不在乎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that all your friends are dead because of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.52,1:34:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.42,1:34:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.92,1:34:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过是些麻烦而已 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were loose ends, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.09,1:34:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是我的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing but loose ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.29,1:34:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着他们一个个死去的时候 你知道我在想什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to know what I thought when I watched them each die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.06,1:34:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,“又少了一个人跟我分钱”\N{\fnArial\fs30}One less person to split the money with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.87,1:34:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.77,1:34:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮了我一个忙呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did me a favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.17,1:34:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个要想分钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to get the money back from me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.51,1:34:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要先把钱从我这里拿回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you two can split it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.74,1:34:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,把钱拿回来很容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we'll get the money back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.58,1:34:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.01,1:34:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她最后也会杀了你的 你知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know she's eventually gonna kill you, too, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.58,1:34:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的吧 阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck off, Amanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.91,1:34:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.55,1:34:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也会背叛你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna burn you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.22,1:34:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是还没看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just can't see it yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.02,1:34:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}God{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.49,1:34:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就剩这点本事了 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that really all you've got left, John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.16,1:34:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我知道你是谁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I realized who you really were{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.99,1:34:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,天杀的“竖锯”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jig-fucking-saw{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.53,1:35:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a bit worried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.97,1:35:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来还有点担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's honest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.67,1:35:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 伟大的约翰·克莱默\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, the great John Kramer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.17,1:35:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,将死于自己设下的陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}is gonna die in one of his own traps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.64,1:35:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么讽刺啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some wicked irony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.31,1:35:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,更讽刺的是 你本来可以离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the crazy thing is, that you could have just walked away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.08,1:35:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以承认自己被骗了 被打败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acknowledged that you got beat, got conned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.82,1:35:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你偏不\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, no{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.76,1:35:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就非得回来 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just had to come back, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.63,1:35:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把这个贱人绑到另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we put this bitch on the other side of that thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.56,1:35:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后开启机关 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and press play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.08,1:35:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个混蛋活不过两个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this fucking asshole is dead in two months, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.96,1:36:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想让他痛苦 就像他想让我痛苦一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I want him to suffer like he made me suffer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.63,1:36:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让他生前的最后记忆 是看着无辜者死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want his last memory to be watching someone innocent die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.73,1:36:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是觉得我无辜\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think I'm innocent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.80,1:36:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.84,1:36:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.01,1:36:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我听到了一个人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think I hear an answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.82,1:36:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 卡洛斯 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Carlos. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.32,1:36:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.49,1:36:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有几个朋友想见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got some friends I want you to meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.32,1:36:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我进去吧 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wanna come inside? - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.83,1:36:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.96,1:36:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.50,1:36:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我找到谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look who I found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.48,1:36:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.65,1:36:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.92,1:37:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.59,1:37:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个我没能预见的可怕后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a terrible, unforeseen consequence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.20,1:37:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这样 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.47,1:37:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这孩子是无辜的 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The boy is innocent. - Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.57,1:37:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果你让他死掉 那就是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if you let him die, it's all on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.35,1:37:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西要怎么开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we get this thing started?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.78,1:37:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有目标才能激活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's activated by the subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.79,1:37:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.12,1:37:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想为任何人的死负责 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you wouldn't be responsible for killing anyone, would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.03,1:37:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的伪君子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking hypocrite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.93,1:37:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在开始之前 你最好把游戏规则告诉这孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you might want to tell the kid the rules before we start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.17,1:37:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没参加游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a player.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.74,1:37:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没参与任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}In any of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.20,1:37:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点吧 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.57,1:37:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,换上那种吓人的语气声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do the scary voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.64,1:38:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,“我要跟你玩个游戏”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'd like to play a game."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.11,1:38:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.21,1:38:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让这孩子不知道规则就开始游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really want the boy to play without hearing the rules?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.08,1:38:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他恐怕不会有什么好下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he's gonna fare well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.13,1:38:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 我会割开他的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, I will cut his throat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.59,1:38:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样做不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.46,1:38:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样做不对 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not right. - Oh, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.19,1:38:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这种人居然给我讲是非对错\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lecture on moral decency from you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.60,1:38:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你十秒钟 然后我就拉动把手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got ten seconds, or I hit the lever myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.87,1:39:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不像你 我没有那么多愚蠢的道德标准\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't have a silly moral code like you, trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.01,1:39:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡洛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlos{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.75,1:39:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comprende?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.49,1:39:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动吧 帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it on, Parker, and let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.50,1:39:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No jalar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.30,1:40:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.60,1:40:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.00,1:41:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是水刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not waterboarding, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.63,1:41:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是血刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood-boarding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.23,1:42:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡洛斯 不要拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No jalar, Carlos No jalar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.91,1:42:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop Stop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.22,1:42:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.62,1:42:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.49,1:42:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 他快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it, you're killing him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.33,1:42:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只需要推动拉杆\N{\fnArial\fs30}All he has to do is push the lever, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.03,1:42:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲那孩子就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}sacrifice the kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.94,1:42:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去拿钱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go and get the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.62,1:43:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到你声音的那一刻 我就知道自己得救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once I heard your voice over that speaker, I knew I'd be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.66,1:43:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信他们居然就这么上钩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe they fell for the whole damn thing, hook, line, and sinker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.00,1:43:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 真是白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know. - Fucking idiots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.31,1:43:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你不是最后一个玩家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you were the last player, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.98,1:43:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想让谁跟你一起玩游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}who was supposed to be on the other side of that plank with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.82,1:43:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.61,1:44:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱呢 钱在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the fucking money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.71,1:44:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.25,1:44:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.08,1:44:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.64,1:45:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子 你是个战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a warrior, my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.54,1:45:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}A warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.87,1:45:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.81,1:45:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟计划不完全一样 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly as we planned it, but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.32,1:45:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did they know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.45,1:45:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么知道你的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did they know about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.36,1:46:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克·希尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker Sears{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.79,1:46:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也参与了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? He was in on it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.73,1:46:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是负责人之一 也是塞西莉亚的姘头\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a handler and he's fucking Cecilia, too{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.93,1:46:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了你要的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was able to find the man you asked for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.27,1:46:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.11,1:46:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 帕克·希尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Parker Sears?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.21,1:46:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得通过其办法找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to find another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.68,1:46:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,上钩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.65,1:46:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a visitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.73,1:46:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞西莉亚·佩德森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cecilia Pederson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.40,1:46:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克·希尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker Sears, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.71,1:46:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们合作行骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've each been working a grift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.64,1:46:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing a role, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.51,1:46:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,互相配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}working together{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.38,1:47:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续着你们的骗局\N{\fnArial\fs30}continuing to play out your scam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.75,1:47:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,却没意识到 你们才是今晚的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never realizing that you have been the marks all night long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.10,1:47:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了你们获得救赎的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were given a chance for redemption, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.80,1:47:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在每个关头 你们都选择死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}but at every turn, you chose death, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.44,1:47:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而没有选择生\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.27,1:47:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证 不管过程如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you, one way or another, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.21,1:47:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一切都会按计划进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's all gonna work out according to plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.55,1:47:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的最后一场骗局已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have played your last con game{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.35,1:47:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还有最后一场游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No - but not your last game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.75,1:47:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们二位曾合作毁灭他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two of you have worked together to destroy others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.36,1:47:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次 你们要相互厮杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you will work against each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.50,1:47:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个人能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one can survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.57,1:47:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择权在你们手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the choice is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.89,1:48:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你把我给忘了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you forgot about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.53,1:48:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意为了你去死 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'd die for you, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.87,1:49:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她最后也会杀掉你的 你知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know she's eventually gonna kill you, too, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.04,1:49:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去你的吧 阿曼达 - 她会背叛你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck off, Amanda. - She's gonna burn you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.67,1:49:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是还没看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just can't see it yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.77,1:49:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.47,1:49:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.17,1:50:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gracias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.54,1:50:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们送你回家 卡洛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you home, Carlos.{\r}
