Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.92,1:52:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的战斗勋章\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my war wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.59,1:52:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的伤疤呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is your scar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.46,1:52:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.90,1:52:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,警探 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Detective, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.30,1:52:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我找到我的癌症病友\N{\fnArial\fs30}for locating my fellow cancer patient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.01,1:53:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么多人可以骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of all the men to cheat, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.48,1:53:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偏偏挑到了约翰·克莱默\N{\fnArial\fs30}you picked John Kramer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.42,1:53:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.28,1:53:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,太倒霉了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call that epic bad luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.96,1:53:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.99,1:53:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.83,1:53:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.56,1:53:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心 我绝对不会做这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the last thing that you should be worried about.{\r}
